WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.139
Give guests a reason to stop.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.739
A tasting, a hosted lounge,

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.050
or a photo they’ll want to keep.

00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:10.583
We plan and produce sponsor experiences

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:13.294
around what you want people to do.

00:00:13.306 --> 00:00:17.250
We design the space, coordinate vendors and
installation,

00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:19.661
and staff the experience on-site.

00:00:20.661 --> 00:00:23.783
Our production system keeps the brand,
organizer,

00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:27.606
and event team aligned on approvals,
schedules,

00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:30.261
and what to capture for the recap.

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:34.233
Tell us who you want to reach.

00:00:34.244 --> 00:00:36.789
Let’s build the experience around them.
